  Phase 1.15c — minimum Material3 theme. The real colour
  tokens live in the Compose layer (`MaterialTheme` overrides
  in MainActivity); this XML only exists because the Activity
  needs a valid `android:theme` attribute on the manifest tag
  before Compose takes over the render tree.

  `Theme.Material3.DayNight.NoActionBar` follows the system
  light/dark mode automatically — matches the dark-mode toggle
  posture we built into `apps/web` (1.18f), minus the manual
  override (Compose's `isSystemInDarkTheme()` will read the
  same OS preference here when the auth surface lands in
  1.15d and we add the toggle).
-->
